us="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KUBO MINORU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NOZAWA KATSUYA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SAITOH TOHRU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKAGI TAKESHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KUBO, MINORU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NOZAWA, KATSUYA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SAITOH, TOHRU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKAGI, TAKESHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A crystal growing apparatus comprises a vacuum enclosure (10), a heating lamp (12), a lamp controller (13) for controlling the heating lamp (12), a gas inlet (14), a flow rate regulator (15) for regulating the flow rate of gas, a pyrometer (19) for measuring the temperature of a wafer, and a gas supply unit (30) for supplying gas such as Si2H6 to the vacuum enclosure (10). An ellipsometry measuring device comprises a light source (20), a polarizer (21), a modulator (22), an analyzer (24), a spectroscope/detector unit (25), and an analysis controller (26) for calculating  PSI  and  DELTA . Before a chemical oxide layer on the wafer is removed, phase 1 in which the oxide layer covers the wafer and phase 2 in which part of the wafer is exposed are recognized, and gas supply is performed and stopped according to the phase.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Un appareil de tirage de cristaux comporte une enceinte à vide (10), une lampe chauffante (12), un organe de commande de lampe (13) qui commande la lampe chauffante (12), une entrée de gaz (14), un régulateur de débit (15) qui régule le débit de gaz, un pyromètre (19) qui mesure la température d'une plaquette, et une unité d'alimentation en gaz (30) qui envoie du gaz, tel que Si2H6, dans l'enceinte à vide (10). Un dispositif de mesure par ellipsométrie comprend une source de lumière (20), un polariseur (21), un modulateur (22), un analyseur (24), une unité formant détecteur/spectroscope (25), et un organe de commande d'analyse (26) qui calcule  PSI  et  DELTA . Avant l'enlèvement de la couche d'oxyde chimique de la plaquette, la phase 1 dans laquelle la couche d'oxyde recouvre la plaquette et la phase 2 dans laquelle une partie de la plaquette est exposée, sont reconnues, l'alimentation en gaz étant assurée et stoppée selon la phase.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>